error[DS0005]: unknown escape sequence `\q`
  --> query:1:18
  |
1 | t | where a == 'x\q' and b > 3y
  |                  ^^ not a valid escape
  |
  = help: to write a backslash, double it: `'x\\q'`
  = note: valid escapes are `\\`, `\"`, `\'`, `\n`, `\r`, `\t`, `\0` and `\u{...}`

error[DS0003]: unknown timespan unit `y`
  --> query:1:31
  |
1 | t | where a == 'x\q' and b > 3y
  |                               ^ not a timespan unit
  |
  = help: valid units are `d`, `h`, `m` (minutes), `s`, `ms`, `us` (or `µs`) and `tick` (100 ns)
